# Client (React)

## API

- Thin wrappers over `fetchJson` in `client/src/api/*`
- Call `/api/v1/...` (Vite proxies `/api` to the server)
- Colocate request types with the API module or `client/src/types/`

## UI & layout

- Pages: `client/src/pages/` (PascalCase)
- Feature UI: `client/src/components/<domain-kebab>/`
- Primitives: extend `client/src/components/ui` (Radix + CVA + `cn`) — do not scaffold a second shadcn CLI system

## State & forms

- Prefer local state and existing contexts (`TaskQueueContext`, theme, toast)
- Do **not** add Redux, Zustand, or React Query unless the user asks
- Use react-hook-form when the surrounding domain already does
